---
# Vendored Analog Devices ADBMS6830 driver code. Extends
# Tractive_Battery/.clang-tidy but drops style checks, since we don't
# restyle vendor code. Bug checks (clang-analyzer-*, most bugprone-*) stay on.
InheritParentConfig: true

Checks: >
  -readability-*,
  -cppcoreguidelines-init-variables,
  -bugprone-narrowing-conversions,
  -bugprone-reserved-identifier
